# Binaries staged for upload somewhere else. Built with
#   pio run -e LilyGo_TDeck_rift -t mergebin
# which is a manual target, not a post-build step - the release workflow calls it,
# a local build does not. Nothing here belongs in the repo: the canonical copy of
# each release is the GitHub Pages flasher's rift-merged.bin.
dist/
